\item Consensus emerges around valid proofs
\end{itemize}

\section{Meaning and Purpose}

\subsection{Mathematics as Existential Anchor}

Traditional religion provides:
\begin{enumerate}[noitemsep]
\item Objective meaning (God's plan)
\item Connection to transcendence (prayer, worship)
